#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#. type: Title #
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker installation"
msgstr "Instalação via Docker"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:10
msgid ""
"Zammad can be deployed using Docker Compose. You can even use graphical "
"Docker front ends like [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"O Zammad pode ser implantado usando o Docker Compose. Você pode até usar "
"interfaces gráficas do Docker, como o [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/)"
"{target=_blank}."

#. type: Fenced div block (info)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"We do not provide support in terms of Docker (-Compose) or Portainer specific\n"
"problems. If you choose to run Zammad via Docker, support is only provided for\n"
"the Zammad application.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Não fornecemos suporte para problemas específicos do Docker (Compose) ou Portainer.\n"
"Se você optar por executar o Zammad via Docker, o suporte é fornecido apenas para\n"
"a aplicação Zammad.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:23
msgid "A working Docker Compose environment"
msgstr "Um ambiente Docker Compose funcional"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:23
msgid "At least 4 GB of RAM to run the containers"
msgstr "Pelo menos 4 GB de RAM para executar os containers"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:23
msgid "Increase the memory limit for Elasticsearch on Linux hosts:"
msgstr "Aumente o limite de memória para o Elasticsearch em hosts Linux:"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "  sudo sysctl -w vm.max_map_count=262144\n"
msgstr "  sudo sysctl -w vm.max_map_count=262144\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment with Portainer"
msgstr "Implantação com Portainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:34
msgid ""
"The easiest way to get Zammad running is via a graphical Docker UI. We "
"recommend [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/){target=_blank}. For "
"installation instructions, check out [Portainer's documentation](https://"
"docs.portainer.io/){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"A forma mais fácil de colocar o Zammad em execução é via uma interface "
"gráfica do Docker. Recomendamos o [Portainer](https://www.portainer.io/)"
"{target=_blank}. Para instruções de instalação, consulte a [documentação do "
"Portainer](https://docs.portainer.io/){target=_blank}."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Add stack"
msgstr "Etapa 1: adicionar stack"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:40
msgid ""
"In the Portainer GUI (e.g. `https://yourdomain.tld:9443`), choose your "
"target environment, select **Stacks** and click on `Add stack` as you can "
"see in the screenshot below."
msgstr ""
"Na interface gráfica do Portainer (por exemplo, `https://"
"yourdomain.tld:9443`), escolha seu ambiente de destino, selecione **Stacks** "
"e clique em `Add stack`, como você pode ver na captura de tela abaixo."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:42
msgid ""
"![Screenshot in the Stacks section and highlighted \"Add stack\".](/"
"screenshots/get-started/installation/portainer-stacks.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Captura de tela na seção Stacks com \"Add stack\" destacado.](/screenshots/"
"get-started/installation/portainer-stacks.png)"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Build from repository"
msgstr "Etapa 2: construir a partir do repositório"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:46
msgid ""
"Switch to **Repository** build method and provide the information below:"
msgstr ""
"Mude para o método de build **Repository** e forneça as informações abaixo:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:51
msgid "**Name**: enter a desired name of the stack"
msgstr "**Name**: informe um nome desejado para a stack"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:51
msgid "**Repository URL**: `https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose`"
msgstr "**Repository URL**: `https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:51
msgid "**Repository reference**: `refs/heads/master`"
msgstr "**Repository reference**: `refs/heads/master`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:51
msgid "**Compose path**: `docker-compose.yml` (default)"
msgstr "**Compose path**: `docker-compose.yml` (padrão)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:55
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:81
msgid ""
"In case our default environment is not what you are looking for, you can "
"customize the stack using predefined scenarios and adjust environment "
"variables. Jump to the [customization section](#customizing-the-zammad-"
"stack) below to find more information."
msgstr ""
"Caso nosso ambiente padrão não seja o que você procura, você pode "
"personalizar a stack usando cenários predefinidos e ajustar variáveis de "
"ambiente. Vá até a [seção de personalização](#customizing-the-zammad-stack) "
"abaixo para mais informações."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:57
msgid ""
"![Stack creation with provided information in Repository screen](/"
"screenshots/get-started/installation/portainer-stack-creation.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Criação de stack com as informações fornecidas na tela Repository](/"
"screenshots/get-started/installation/portainer-stack-creation.png)"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Deploy the stack"
msgstr "Etapa 3: implantar a stack"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:61
msgid ""
"Finally, click `Deploy the stack` button. The first time, it may take some "
"time until the Docker images are fetched."
msgstr ""
"Por fim, clique no botão `Deploy the stack`. Na primeira vez, pode levar "
"algum tempo até que as imagens do Docker sejam baixadas."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:64
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:97
msgid ""
"After the stack is ready, you can access Zammad via the configured Docker "
"host and port, e.g. `http://localhost:8080/`."
msgstr ""
"Depois que a stack estiver pronta, você pode acessar o Zammad pelo host e "
"porta Docker configurados, por exemplo, `http://localhost:8080/`."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment with Docker Compose"
msgstr "Implantação com Docker Compose"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Clone the GitHub repo"
msgstr "Etapa 1: clonar o repositório do GitHub"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "git clone https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose.git\n"
msgstr "git clone https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose.git\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:75
msgid ""
"Make sure to run `git pull` frequently to fetch updates. Alternatively, you "
"can download the files from the [releases page](https://github.com/zammad/"
"zammad-docker-compose/releases){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de executar `git pull` frequentemente para buscar "
"atualizações. Como alternativa, você pode baixar os arquivos da [página de "
"releases](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/releases)"
"{target=_blank}."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Adjust environment as needed"
msgstr "Etapa 2: ajustar o ambiente conforme necessário"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Start the stack"
msgstr "Etapa 3: iniciar a stack"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:84
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:223
#, no-wrap
msgid "cd zammad-docker-compose\n"
msgstr "cd zammad-docker-compose\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:88
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:235
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose up -d\n"
msgstr "docker compose up -d\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:94
msgid ""
"Optional: Use an additional `.yml` file to use a pre-defines scenario. Read "
"on in the [Customizing the Zammad Stack](#customizing-the-zammad-stack) "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Opcional: use um arquivo `.yml` adicional para usar um cenário predefinido. "
"Continue lendo na seção [Personalizando a stack do Zammad](#customizing-the-"
"zammad-stack)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exposing the stack via HTTPS"
msgstr "Expondo a stack via HTTPS"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:102
msgid ""
"To publish a Zammad stack on the internet, it needs be secured via the HTTPS "
"protocol. To achieve that without modifying the Zammad stack, you can:"
msgstr ""
"Para publicar uma stack do Zammad na internet, ela precisa ser protegida via "
"protocolo HTTPS. Para conseguir isso sem modificar a stack do Zammad, você "
"pode:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:106
msgid ""
"Use a reverse proxy like Nginx Proxy Manager (NPM). It has a GUI that "
"provides an easy [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/){target=_blank} "
"integration."
msgstr ""
"Usar um proxy reverso como o Nginx Proxy Manager (NPM). Ele tem uma "
"interface gráfica que oferece uma integração fácil com o [Let's Encrypt]"
"(https://letsencrypt.org/){target=_blank}."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:106
msgid "Use a Cloudflare tunnel, which provides SSL termination."
msgstr "Usar um túnel do Cloudflare, que oferece terminação SSL."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:108
msgid ""
"Both scenarios are covered in the separate [Docker Compose Scenarios](/en/"
"reference/docker-compose-scenarios) page."
msgstr ""
"Ambos os cenários são cobertos na página separada [Cenários do Docker "
"Compose](/pt_BR/reference/docker-compose-scenarios)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "Customizing the Zammad stack"
msgstr "Personalizando a stack do Zammad"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:114
msgid ""
"The Zammad stack can be customized by loading additional scenario files for "
"common use cases. For example, you can deploy the stack with an included "
"Nginx Proxy Manager (NPM) or with disabled PostgreSQL or Elasticsearch "
"services, in case you already have these services running."
msgstr ""
"A stack do Zammad pode ser personalizada carregando arquivos de cenário "
"adicionais para casos de uso comuns. Por exemplo, você pode implantar a "
"stack com um Nginx Proxy Manager (NPM) incluído, ou com os serviços "
"PostgreSQL ou Elasticsearch desativados, caso você já tenha esses serviços "
"em execução."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:116
msgid ""
"Please see the [Docker Compose scenarios page](/en/reference/docker-compose-"
"scenarios)."
msgstr ""
"Consulte a [página de cenários do Docker Compose](/pt_BR/reference/docker-"
"compose-scenarios)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:118
msgid ""
"To adjust the stack and settings, use [Docker specific environment variables]"
"(/en/reference/environment-variables)."
msgstr ""
"Para ajustar a stack e as configurações, use [variáveis de ambiente "
"específicas do Docker](/pt_BR/reference/environment-variables)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to run commands in the stack"
msgstr "Como executar comandos na stack"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:123
msgid ""
"Execute commands in your Docker stack by calling `rails` or `rake` via one "
"of the following methods by using `bundle exec`."
msgstr ""
"Execute comandos na sua stack do Docker chamando `rails` ou `rake` por um "
"dos seguintes métodos, usando `bundle exec`."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:docker-portainer)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:124
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Docker Compose\n"
"\n"
"Directly execute a specific command:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rails r '...your rails command here...'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Run the interactive Rails console to manually enter Rails commands:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Via `docker compose exec`:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose exec zammad-railsserver bundle exec rails r '...your rails command here...'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Docker Compose\n"
"\n"
"Execute diretamente um comando específico:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rails r '...seu comando rails aqui...'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Execute o console interativo do Rails para inserir comandos Rails manualmente:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Via `docker compose exec`:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose exec zammad-railsserver bundle exec rails r '...seu comando rails aqui...'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:docker-portainer|tip)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:124
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you need to retrieve information from the Rails server, you can, for example,\n"
"place `pp` (pretty print) in front of your Rails command. This leads to an\n"
"output in your terminal.\n"
msgstr ""
"Se você precisar recuperar informações do servidor Rails, você pode, por exemplo,\n"
"colocar `pp` (pretty print) antes do seu comando Rails. Isso resulta em\n"
"uma saída no seu terminal.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:docker-portainer)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:124
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Portainer\n"
"\n"
"In your Portainer GUI, go to the container view and select the running Rails container from your Zammad stack. Click\n"
"on the **Exec Console** icon in the \"Quick Actions\" column, select the standard `/bin/bash` entrypoint and click\n"
"**Connect**.\n"
"\n"
"![Portainer console execution](/screenshots/get-started/installation/portainer-exec-console.png){width=80%}\n"
"\n"
"Run the interactive Rails console by executing:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"bundle exec rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Directly execute a specific command:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"bundle exec rails r '...your rails command here...'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Portainer\n"
"\n"
"Na sua interface gráfica do Portainer, vá até a visualização de containers e selecione o container Rails em execução da sua stack do Zammad. Clique\n"
"no ícone **Exec Console** na coluna \"Quick Actions\", selecione o ponto de entrada padrão `/bin/bash` e clique\n"
"**Connect**.\n"
"\n"
"![Execução do console do Portainer](/screenshots/get-started/installation/portainer-exec-console.png){width=80%}\n"
"\n"
"Execute o console interativo do Rails executando:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"bundle exec rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Execute diretamente um comando específico:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"bundle exec rails r '...seu comando rails aqui...'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

