msgstr "Instalação via pacote"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported operating systems"
msgstr "Sistemas operacionais suportados"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:13
msgid ""
"For package installation, the following Linux distributions are supported:"
msgstr ""
"Para instalação via pacote, as seguintes distribuições Linux são suportadas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:24
msgid ""
"If your distribution is not supported, feel free to use a different "
"installation method or consider using [Zammad's cloud service](https://"
"zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank}."
msgstr ""
"Se sua distribuição não for suportada, sinta-se à vontade para usar outro "
"método de instalação, ou considere usar o [serviço de nuvem do Zammad]"
"(https://zammad.com/en/pricing){target=_blank}."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:27
msgid ""
"To follow the installation steps below, tools like curl, gnupg and others "
"are required. If they are not present on your system, install them:"
msgstr ""
"Para seguir as etapas de instalação abaixo, ferramentas como curl, gnupg e "
"outras são necessárias. Se elas não estiverem presentes no seu sistema, "
"instale-as:"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"OpenSUSE doesn't require any additional steps here!\n"
"\n"
"SLES 15 requires additional repositories to be activated. To do so, run the following commands.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product sle-module-desktop-applications/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product PackageHub/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf install curl epel-release\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt install curl apt-transport-https gnupg\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"O OpenSUSE não requer nenhuma etapa adicional aqui!\n"
"\n"
"O SLES 15 requer que repositórios adicionais sejam ativados. Para isso, execute os seguintes comandos.\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product sle-module-desktop-applications/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo SUSEConnect --product PackageHub/$(. /etc/os-release; echo $VERSION_ID)/$(uname -i)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf install curl epel-release\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

