#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/index.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "REST API"
msgstr "API REST"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:10
msgid ""
"Zammad provides a powerful REST-API[^1] which allows all operations that are "
"available via UI as well."
msgstr ""
"O Zammad oferece uma poderosa API REST[^1], que permite todas as operações "
"também disponíveis via interface."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:13
msgid ""
"This page gives you a first impression for things that generally count for "
"all endpoints and how to adapt."
msgstr ""
"Esta página dá uma primeira impressão sobre coisas que geralmente valem para "
"todos os endpoints e como se adaptar."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "API clients"
msgstr "Clientes de API"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:18
msgid ""
"There are API clients available. Please note that these clients may not "
"provide access to all available endpoints listed here."
msgstr ""
"Há clientes de API disponíveis. Observe que esses clientes podem não "
"fornecer acesso a todos os endpoints disponíveis listados aqui."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:30
msgid ""
"[Ruby Client](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-api-client-ruby)"
"{target=_blank} (official)"
msgstr ""
"[Cliente Ruby](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-api-client-ruby)"
"{target=_blank} (oficial)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:30
msgid ""
"[PHP Client](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-api-client-php){target=_blank} "
"(official)"
msgstr ""
"[Cliente PHP](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-api-client-php)"
"{target=_blank} (oficial)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:30
msgid ""
"[Python Client](https://pypi.org/project/zammad-py/){target=_blank} (third "
"party)"
msgstr ""
"[Cliente Python](https://pypi.org/project/zammad-py/){target=_blank} "
"(terceiros)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:30
msgid ""
"[.NET Client](https://github.com/Asesjix/Zammad-Client){target=_blank} "
"(third party)"
msgstr ""
"[Cliente .NET](https://github.com/Asesjix/Zammad-Client){target=_blank} "
"(terceiros)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
